      "content": "that's a good start. i like the idea of them being more instinctual. to really drive home that contrast between them and the \"civilized\" heroes, can you go a bit deeper into their physical appearance and social hierarchy? i want them to look and act significantly different—maybe even a bit more animalistic or less \"human\" in their mannerisms to show how far removed they are from the enlightened protagonists. what would their skin tones and facial features look like to emphasize that they come from a different, more raw part of the world?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
